    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d397-a6">

                <pb facs="0518" n="410" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg410"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 490.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Forbes to Mr. Sutton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guaymas, Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Yours of the 27th of last month
                    reached me only day before yesterday, and in answer thereto I beg leave to
                    inform you that all you suggest has been done in Mr. Lycan’s case, and the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">amparo</hi> proceedings, as decided in his favor by the
                    district court, have been forwarded to the capital to await the action of the
                    supreme court thereon. No charges have been filed here against him, and he
                    continues <pb facs="0519" n="411" xml:id="pg411"/> out of jail but under
                    constant guard. I can give you no further information on the subject, except as
                    to what Mr. Lycan intends to do as soon as the schooner <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dora Bluhm</hi> arrives in this harbor; that is to say, he will have his
                    lawyer claim the vessel both on account of his purchase and also for salvage, to
                    which, in any event, he believes he is entitled.</p>
                <p>Yours, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alexander Forbes.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
